  annotation(Documentation(info="<html>
<p>Multipoles <code>l = 2..29</code> unbinned (Commander; asymmetric errors), then the 83 bins of the
high-<code>l</code> Plik likelihood (<code>l &asymp; 48..2499</code>, symmetric errors; the bins are
correlated at the per-cent level, so a chi-square with these diagonal errors is indicative only).</p>
<p>Planck Collaboration, <i>Planck 2018 results. I. Overview</i>, A&amp;A 641, A1 (2020) and
<i>VI. Cosmological parameters</i>, A&amp;A 641, A6 (2020); data from the Planck Legacy Archive (ESA), files
<code>COM_PowerSpect_CMB-TT-full_R3.01.txt</code> and <code>COM_PowerSpect_CMB-TT-binned_R3.01.txt</code> as served by
IRSA (<code>irsa.ipac.caltech.edu/data/Planck/release_3/ancillary-data/cosmoparams/</code>).</p>
</html>"));
